WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.808
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with

00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:06.728
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:10.733
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:16.704
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times. Record why your chosen technique suits

00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:17.443
the message.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:21.590
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together.
